{"id":"00159","root":"uni00159_1","name":{"ja":"ラークシャシャ","en":"Lark Shasha"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"ラークシャシャ","en":"Lark Shasha"},"aliases":["Larkshasha"],"element":"Superhuman","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Oni"],"release":"2019-01-31","limited":false,"characterId":129,"profile":{"ja":"上級鬼族の女戦士。鬼族は、下級の子鬼＜ゴブリン＞や食人鬼＜オーガ＞から、上級の鬼まで様々に存在するが、ラークシャシャは羅刹と称される神話級の恐るべき鬼。魔界における勢力争いでエドウィン・ブラックに敗れ、力の大半を奪われる。力を取り戻すため彼女は人間界に渡り、不死の王を追跡する。鍛え抜かれた女豹のような肉体に冷たくはあるが美しき容貌、その色香に誘われて安易に彼女に近づくと無残な死が待っている。鬼族の女にとって男を試す手段は命を掛けた戦いしかないのだから。怨念漂う血塗られた鬼の金棒を２本自在に操る二刀流。","en":"Lark Shasha is a senior-ranked female demon warrior. While demons range from low-rank goblins and ogres to high-rank demons, Lark Shasha is a mythic-level \"Rasetsu\" feared across legends. Defeated by Edwin Black in a power struggle within the Demon Realm, she lost most of her strength. To regain it, she crossed into the Human Realm to hunt the Immortal King. Her body, honed like a female leopard, is both cold and beautiful, and those who are seduced by her allure meet a gruesome death. For a demon woman, the only way to test a man is a life-or-death battle. She wields two blood-stained demon clubs, manipulating them freely in a dual-blade style."},"illustrator":"ここのき奈緒","voiceActor":"星もえる","forms":[{"id":"uni00159_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[758,1516],"sp":[170,170],"atk":[121,242],"def":[90,180],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","100009"]},{"id":"uni00159_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1116,2233],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[192,384],"def":[130,267],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","100009","100010"]},{"id":"uni00159_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1474,2950],"sp":[340,340],"atk":[263,526],"def":[170,351],"spd":[54,54],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["1","100009","100010"]}],"skills":{"1":{"slot":"attack","id":1,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels"